### 1) 健康检查
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X GET http://127.0.0.1:18080/health 
{
    "status": "ok",
    "windowMs": 10000,
    "groups": 0
}
### 2) 插入事件（窗口 10000ms，全部使用显式逻辑时间戳 ts）
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/events --data '{"eventId":"e1","itemId":"bob","delta":5,"ts":1000}'
{
    "status": "INSERTED",
    "eventId": "e1",
    "itemId": "bob",
    "delta": 5,
    "ts": 1000,
    "watermark": 1000,
    "activeEvents": 1,
    "activeItems": 1
}
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/events --data '{"eventId":"e2","itemId":"ada","delta":5,"ts":1001}'
