### 3) 查询 Top2（dan=8 第一；ada/bob/cyb 同为 5，按 ID 字典序 ada 第二）
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X GET http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/topk?k=2&ts=2000 
{
    "group": "leaderboard",
    "k": 2,
    "windowMs": 10000,
    "count": 2,
    "items": [
        {
            "rank": 1,
            "itemId": "dan",
            "score": 8
        },
        {
            "rank": 2,
            "itemId": "ada",
            "score": 5
        }
    ],
    "watermark": 2000,
    "windowStart": -8000
}
### 4) 负增量：ada 再发一条 delta=-9 -> ada=-4 垫底；K=100 大于元素数，返回全部
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/events --data '{"eventId":"e5","itemId":"ada","delta":-9,"ts":2001}'
{
    "status": "INSERTED",
    "eventId": "e5",
    "itemId": "ada",
    "delta": -9,
    "ts": 2001,
    "watermark": 2001,
    "activeEvents": 5,
    "activeItems": 4
}
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X GET http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/topk?k=100&ts=3000 
{
    "group": "leaderboard",
    "k": 100,
