### 5) 撤回 e5（ada 恢复 5 分）
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/retract --data '{"eventId":"e5","ts":4000}'
{
    "status": "RETRACTED",
    "eventId": "e5",
    "ts": 4000,
    "watermark": 4000,
    "activeEvents": 4,
    "activeItems": 4
}
### 5b) 重复撤回：幂等，返回 ALREADY_RETRACTED，不二次扣减
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/retract --data '{"eventId":"e5","ts":4001}'
{
    "status": "ALREADY_RETRACTED",
    "eventId": "e5",
    "ts": 4001,
    "watermark": 4001,
    "activeEvents": 4,
    "activeItems": 4
}
