### 7) 迟到事件被拒（422 LATE）；重复 eventId 被拒（409 DUPLICATE）
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/events --data '{"eventId":"late","itemId":"x","delta":1,"ts":1}'
{
    "status": "LATE",
    "eventId": "late",
    "itemId": "x",
    "delta": 1,
    "ts": 1,
    "watermark": 11000,
    "activeEvents": 3,
    "activeItems": 3,
    "error": "\u4e8b\u4ef6\u65f6\u95f4\u5df2\u6ed1\u51fa\u7a97\u53e3\uff08\u8fdf\u5230\u4e8b\u4ef6\uff09\uff0c\u672a\u88ab\u63a5\u53d7"
}
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/events --data '{"eventId":"e2","itemId":"ada","delta":5,"ts":2000}'
{
    "status": "DUPLICATE",
    "eventId": "e2",
    "itemId": "ada",
    "delta": 5,
    "ts": 2000,
    "watermark": 11000,
    "activeEvents": 3,
    "activeItems": 3,
    "error": "eventId \u5728\u7a97\u53e3\u5185\u5df2\u5b58\u5728\uff08\u6216\u5728\u64a4\u56de\u4fdd\u7559\u671f\u5185\uff09"
}
### 8) 撤回已过期事件（404 EVENT_UNKNOWN）
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X POST http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/retract --data '{"eventId":"e1","ts":11000}'
{
    "status": "EVENT_UNKNOWN",
    "eventId": "e1",
    "ts": 11000,
    "watermark": 11000,
    "activeEvents": 3,
    "activeItems": 3,
    "error": "\u4e8b\u4ef6\u4e0d\u5b58\u5728\u6216\u5df2\u8fc7\u671f\u6ed1\u51fa\u7a97\u53e3\uff0c\u65e0\u6cd5\u64a4\u56de"
}
### 9) 内部快照（完整排序 + 计数，便于排障）
────────────────────────────────────────
$ curl -X GET http://127.0.0.1:18080/groups/leaderboard/snapshot 
{
    "windowMs": 10000,
    "watermark": 11000,
    "activeEvents": 3,
    "activeItems": 3,
    "tombstones": 1,
    "expiryQueue": 4,
    "items": [
        {
            "itemId": "dan",
            "score": 8
        },
        {
            "itemId": "ada",
            "score": 5
        },
        {
            "itemId": "cyb",
            "score": 5
        }
    ]
}
